{%- comment -%}
====================================================================
 robots.txt.liquid — kraftmart.shop
 Rebuilt: June 29, 2026

 WHY THIS STRUCTURE:
 Shopify maintains a default rule set (accessed via robots.default_groups)
 covering *, adsbot-google, Nutch, AhrefsBot, AhrefsSiteAudit, MJ12bot,
 and Pinterest, and updates it over time. Looping over that object
 instead of hand-typing every rule means this file automatically
 inherits future Shopify-side SEO/crawl fixes. Custom rules below are
 layered ON TOP of the defaults, not a replacement for them.

 Docs: https://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/themes/seo/robots-txt

 ⚠️ Shopify support classifies robots.txt.liquid edits as an
 unsupported customization. Test at kraftmart.shop/robots.txt and in
 Google Search Console's robots.txt tooling before relying on this.
====================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- for group in robots.default_groups -%}
{{ group.user_agent }}
{%- for rule in group.rules -%}
{{ rule }}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if group.user_agent.value == '*' -%}
{%- comment -%} ---- Store-specific duplicate-content / tracking-parameter hygiene, layered on top of Shopify's own "*" defaults ---- {%- endcomment -%}
Disallow: /*?*oseid=*
Disallow: /*?currency=*
Disallow: /*?*ls=*&ls=*
Disallow: /*/*?*ls=*&ls=*
Disallow: /*/*?*ls%3D*%3Fls%3D*
Disallow: /*/*?*ls%3d*%3fls%3d*
Disallow: /*?utm_*
Disallow: /*&utm_*
Disallow: /*?pr_*
Disallow: /*&pr_*
Disallow: /*?filter.v.*
Disallow: /*&filter.v.*
Disallow: */collections/*filter*&*filter*
Disallow: /a/downloads/-/*
{%- endif -%}
{%- if group.sitemap != blank -%}
{{ group.sitemap }}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

